"@id": "http://data.europa.eu/it6/AIAgent",
"@type": "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class",
"ap-definition-en" : {"en": "An AI system or a coordinated set of AI systems that can perceive and act upon their environment, with a degree of autonomy, using tools as needed to achieve specific goals and adapt to changing inputs and contexts."}, "ap-usageNote-en" : {"en": "An AI agent is an AI system, so all properties of AI system apply. Use has interface for how the agent is invoked, uses service and uses software for what the agent calls, and has component for the AI systems that form the agent. The definition follows a #NOTES#An AI agent is an AI system, so all properties of AI system apply. Use has interface for how the agent is invoked, uses service and uses software for what the agent calls, and has component for the AI systems that form the agent. The definition follows a proposal and may change."}, "usage" : {"en": "An AI agent is an AI system, so all properties of AI system apply. Use has interface for how the agent is invoked, uses service and uses software for what the agent calls, and has component for the AI systems that form the agent. The definition follows a #NOTES#An AI agent is an AI system, so all properties of AI system apply. Use has interface for how the agent is invoked, uses service and uses software for what the agent calls, and has component for the AI systems that form the agent. The definition follows a proposal and may change."}, "ap-label-en" : {"en": "AI Agent"}, "definition" : {"en": "An AI system or a coordinated set of AI systems that can perceive and act upon their environment, with a degree of autonomy, using tools as needed to achieve specific goals and adapt to changing inputs and contexts."}, "label" : {"en": "AI Agent"},
