"@type": "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class",
"ap-definition-en" : {"en": "A feature or protocol extension that an AI agent supports, for example streaming, push notifications or an extension of the A2A protocol."}, "ap-usageNote-en" : {"en": "A capability describes how the agent can be used, not what it can do. The AgentCapabilities of an A2A Agent Card map to this class. What the agent can do is described with skill.#NOTES#A capability describes how the agent can be used, not what it can do. The AgentCapabilities of an A2A Agent Card map to this class. What the agent can do is described with skill."}, "usage" : {"en": "A capability describes how the agent can be used, not what it can do. The AgentCapabilities of an A2A Agent Card map to this class. What the agent can do is described with skill.#NOTES#A capability describes how the agent can be used, not what it can do. The AgentCapabilities of an A2A Agent Card map to this class. What the agent can do is described with skill."}, "ap-label-en" : {"en": "Capability"}, "definition" : {"en": "A feature or protocol extension that an AI agent supports, for example streaming, push notifications or an extension of the A2A protocol."}, "label" : {"en": "Capability"},
